      "kind": "figure",
      "alt": "Figure 1. Drawings of Team Radio: Notice this exploratory sketch shows the context of use and not simply the systems interface. Note that most tools force designers to focus exclusively on the GUI"
    },
    {
      "path": "figures/ozenc-how-support-designers-chi2010/figure-002-p006.png",
